Package: jaspSyntheticData
Type: Package
Title: Generate Synthetic Data in JASP
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-10-01
Authors@R:
    person("Erin M.", "Buchanan", email = "buchananlab@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9689-4189"))
Description: A JASP module that generates synthetic versions of a dataset with
    the 'synthpop' package, so researchers can share data that cannot be released
    in its original form. It reports per-variable and overall utility
    (pMSE and standardized pMSE), plots original and synthetic distributions,
    and exports the synthetic dataset as a CSV file.
URL: https://github.com/doomlab/jasp-synthetic-data
BugReports: https://github.com/doomlab/jasp-synthetic-data/issues
